From 75ac12ac23cd084f619b9340aacd797e661a7fbb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 14:14:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD selected-agent slash commands through backend
 execution to avoid prompt fallback

Slash-only messages for a selected agent run through the provider command path so supported backends receive raw commands and unsupported backends report an error instead of treating the input as an ordinary prompt.
